<title>POLAND: Zloty fixed flat at 1.48 pct from parity rate.</title>
<headline>Zloty fixed flat at 1.48 pct from parity rate.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.2370 to the dollar, down from 3.2280 on Thursday and at 1.8640 to the mark, up from 1.8675, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of 1.48 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, nearly unchanged from Thursday's 1.49 percent fix.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
